      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two major railroads—the B&O and the Pittsburgh & Connellsville—made Rockwood a bustling hub for loggers and iron workers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
